# The build only needs the entrypoint and the game's own scripts. Keep the data
# tree, the docs and the other games out of the context.
#
# Every new game must add nothing here: games/*/scripts/ already covers it.
*
!shared/scripts/
!games/*/scripts/
# CI's lint step (py_compile) creates these before the build step runs; last
# match wins, so these must stay after the re-inclusions above.
games/*/scripts/__pycache__/
shared/scripts/__pycache__/
